<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>What Are You Waiting For</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">d4vd</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">WITHERED</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">3TesGaCMKpcLnZackJcBX8</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:01.820" end="00:04.750">I see you from across the room</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:04.750" end="00:07.690">I thought I wouldn't feel a thing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:07.690" end="00:10.650">I think it's getting colder now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.650" end="00:13.500">I wanna get close to you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.500" end="00:16.440">I swear that we've been here before</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.440" end="00:19.080">I guess you didn't notice me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.080" end="00:21.790">But you do now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.790" end="00:25.060">Oh, you do now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.060" end="00:28.090">What are you waiting for?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.090" end="00:30.870">What are you waiting for?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.870" end="00:33.740">'Cause I've been standing here</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.740" end="00:36.770">Oh, I've been standing here</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.770" end="00:39.680">What are you waiting for?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.680" end="00:42.410">What are you waiting for?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.410" end="00:45.380">'Cause I've been standing here</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.380" end="00:48.610">It's never been so clear</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.610" end="00:51.820">I get it if you wanna wait 'cause I'll stay in my place</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.820" end="00:54.540">I ain't got nowhere to go, I got plenty time to waste</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.540" end="00:57.730">I think I've fallen in love, but that's not enough</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.730" end="01:00.310">If you don't feel the same, I guess I'll leave you alone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.310" end="01:03.750">But it's time and time again, babe, you're never listening, babe</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.750" end="01:06.720">If there's no promises made, I don't ever wanna fall in love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.720" end="01:11.560">I don't ever wanna mess it up, we're running out of luck</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.560" end="01:14.430">What are you waiting for?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.430" end="01:17.160">What are you waiting for?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.160" end="01:20.020">'Cause I've been standing here</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.020" end="01:23.000">Oh, I've been standing here</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.000" end="01:25.930">What are you waiting for?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.930" end="01:28.740">What are you waiting for?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.740" end="01:31.580">'Cause I've been standing here</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.580" end="01:36.300">It's never been so clear</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.300" end="01:39.220">Why do you wait? Why do you wait?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.220" end="01:42.050">Why do you wait? Why do you wait?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.050" end="01:44.980">Why do you wait? Why do you wait?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.980" end="01:47.320">Why do you wait? Why do you wait?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.320" end="01:50.230">Tell me to stay, you're wasting my time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.230" end="01:53.120">Every day, I'm waiting in line</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.120" end="01:55.920">Standing in place 'cause, baby, that's all I know</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.920" end="01:57.850">Why do you wait? Just tell me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.850" end="02:00.740">What are you waiting for?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.740" end="02:03.450">What are you waiting for?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.450" end="02:06.330">'Cause I've been standing here</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.330" end="02:09.380">Oh, I've been standing here</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.380" end="02:12.300">What are you waiting for?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.300" end="02:14.890">What are you waiting for?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.890" end="02:17.950">'Cause I've been standing here</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.950" end="02:21.950">Oh, I've been standing here, oh</p></div></body></tt>